<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs-Monday actual 116,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs-Monday actual 116,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interior Iowa-southern Minnesota actual hog receipts for Monday were 116,000, versus the estimate of 110,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows</p>
<p>and Gilts $1.00-$1.50 lower compared to mid-session Monday.</p>
<p>US 1-3 46-49% Carcass Base Lean*  Country	    Plants</p>
<p>220-260 lbs			54.50 -55.50	  55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few				  54.00 -56.00	  55.00 -57.00</p>
<p>Sows: 450 lbs up steady to 1.00 higher, 450 dn steady to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3</p>
<p>300-450 lbs.		     43.00 -44.00	  43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		     46.00 -47.00	  46.00 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up			47.00 -51.00	  47.00 -52.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
